# Cross-family stress fixture (NOT a viewer/presentation demo).
# Places the cross-family jogCurve anchor at the [0,1] corner inside the walk_2d
# hull. Pairwise pose-seam distance jog<->walk is 217-246 vs 2.6-50 for
# walk-family pairs, so any hull parameter whose blend weights include the jog
# anchor averages logically dissimilar poses and looks non-smooth (within-hull
# jolt). Retained to exercise that data-gap stress case and the resulting
# edge-box acceptance overreach. The canonical single-family demo is
# specs/demo_walk_2d.pmg_spec.
# See docs/audits/jolt-cross-family-diagnosis-20260623.md.

node walk_2d 2
registration walk_2d - - 3 0
parameter_metrics walk_2d turn_rate travel_speed
parameter_calibration walk_2d 5
parameter_support walk_2d triangulated_2d

example walk_2d -0.3 0.0 ../../BVH/walkMoreCurve.bvh
example walk_2d  0.0 0.0 ../../BVH/walkCurve.bvh
example walk_2d  1.0 0.0 ../../BVH/walkTightCurve.bvh start_frame 33 end_frame 67 phase_label left_contact_start contact_start L=contact;R=swing contact_end L=contact;R=swing
example walk_2d  0.0 1.0 ../../BVH/jogCurve.bvh start_frame 23 end_frame 46 phase_label left_contact_start contact_start L=contact;R=swing contact_end L=contact;R=swing
example walk_2d  0.15 0.75 ../../BVH/walkStraightTwiceAsFast.bvh

triangle walk_2d 0 1 4
triangle walk_2d 1 2 4
triangle walk_2d 2 3 4
triangle walk_2d 3 0 4

expect walk_2d spanned_axes 2

edge walk_2d walk_2d
edge_phase_range walk_2d walk_2d 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config walk_2d walk_2d 120 234 3 6 41
